      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I have a clear picture. I'll improve understandability by:\n1. Extracting a `assertDecodesTo` helper to remove repetitive decode-and-assert boilerplate\n2. Using `assertArrayEquals` instead of string comparison for semantic clarity\n3. Using inline array literals instead of verbose multi-line `bits` construction\n4. Adding a named constant for the \"all bits set\" byte used throughout the two-byte tests\n5. Removing unused importsThe improved test compiled successfully."
